WEBVTT

00:02:28.913 --> 00:02:32.204
I started wondering
whether we could decode and manage

00:02:32.204 --> 00:02:35.163
this seemingly intangible
concept of trust.

00:02:35.996 --> 00:02:38.538
I'm pleased to report we are doing it,

00:02:38.579 --> 00:02:40.829
which I believe is really important,

00:02:40.871 --> 00:02:42.246
because from my perspective,

00:02:42.288 --> 00:02:45.538
if we can decode
how trust impacts businesses,

00:02:45.579 --> 00:02:48.079
we can make them more successful,

00:02:48.079 --> 00:02:51.079
which might mean
that their partners and employees

00:02:51.121 --> 00:02:53.454
are more engaged
and can be more cooperative.

00:02:53.829 --> 00:02:58.788
And we, as customers, can be happier,
more satisfied and safer

00:02:58.829 --> 00:03:00.288
when we interact with them.